      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "1972-2004",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "这世界本无真相，只有视角；本无对错，只有立场；本无福苦，只有觉知",
      "totalCount": 465
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 367637254,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_3_480-574",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "480-574",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "苏东坡三起三落，高光时刻少，几乎不在贬地，就在去往贬地的路上，饥寒困顿属人生常态。但观其处世为人和诗词文赋，竟不见嗔怨哀愁，更多的是一个“乐”字，乐山乐水，乐人乐己，仿佛笑口常开的弥勒佛。",
      "totalCount": 420
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 368359616,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_3_1041-1076",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "1041-1076",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "，世间只有一种真正的英雄，那就是认清了生活的真相，依然执着地热爱着生活",
      "totalCount": 364
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 312475181,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_4_677-711",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "677-711",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "轼者，车前横木也，扶木可远瞻识路。辙者，车轮痕迹也，循迹可走向远方。",
      "totalCount": 340
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 87405650,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_6_16625-16684",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "16625-16684",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "战争平息，大宋将蜀地范围的川峡路分为益州、梓州、利州和䕫州四路，合称“川峡四路”或“四川路”，简称“四川”，名由此得。",
      "totalCount": 306
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 437318565,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_3_931-946",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "931-946",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "用之则行，舍之则藏，用舍皆宜。",
      "totalCount": 230
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 65701684,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_4_3128-3144",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "3128-3144",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人生到处知何似，应似飞鸿踏雪泥。",
      "totalCount": 220
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 344365554,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_3_1161-1221",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "1161-1221",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "将苦难转换为圆满，需要智慧，亦需仁心。智者无惑，仁者无忧，勇者无惧。具备不惑之智和不忧之仁，便有足够勇气，直面命运不公。",
      "totalCount": 210
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 434259893,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_3_1438-1534",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "1438-1534",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "更重要的是让自己获得新生，眼前豁然开阔，无惊无险，无怨无悔，唯余悲悯和慈爱。那是真正的大爱，爱天地山水，爱草木生灵，爱君国臣民，爱亲朋邻友。甚至连政敌都爱，如王安石和章惇，不记其仇，只念其好。",
      "totalCount": 210
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 71519680,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_4_1335-1420",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "1335-1420",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "兄弟俩从小一起长大，一起读书，一起赴京赶考，一起高中授官，二十多年来还是头回离别，甚是难分难舍。途中苏轼数度下车，要苏辙回去，苏辙不愿，一直送出四十里外，才下马与兄惜别。",
      "totalCount": 198
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 427038246,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_6_3070-3157",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "3070-3157",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "程氏觉得好笑，却知丈夫计谋得逞，也不追究，乐得教读音，解字义。正是用这种特殊方式，大约两个月，兄弟俩磕磕巴巴，勉强把父亲的这册无头无尾的书读完，从此爱上文字和阅读，终生不渝。",
      "totalCount": 176
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 559311620,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_3_1644-1674",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "1644-1674",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "“心似已灰之木，身如不系之舟。问汝平生功业，黄州惠州儋州。”",
      "totalCount": 162
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 580210574,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_3_1812-1862",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "1812-1862",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "从致君尧舜的儒家入世理想，至物我两忘的道家自由意志，渐臻四大皆空的佛家色空觉境，东坡人生越来越圆满。",
      "totalCount": 153
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 65701684,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_3_1243-1249",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "1243-1249",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "万物皆备于我",
      "totalCount": 150
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 25459424,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_3_1954-1972",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "1954-1972",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人生只有享不了的福，没有受不了的苦。",
      "totalCount": 144
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 519002340,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_3_1560-1576",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "1560-1576",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "九死南荒吾不恨，兹游奇绝冠平生。",
      "totalCount": 143
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 400743849,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_6_24896-24905",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "24896-24905",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "成也萧何，败也萧何",
      "totalCount": 128
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 1942752,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_4_2188-2204",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "2188-2204",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "亦知人生要有别，但恐岁月去飘忽。",
      "totalCount": 126
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 35581914,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_6_3184-3216",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "3184-3216",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "苏洵故意扯去封面，以引起兄弟俩的好奇心和求知欲，竟意外产生奇效。",
      "totalCount": 126
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300228163",
      "userVid": 402705848,
      "bookmarkId": "3300228163_4_481-554",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "481-554",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "大雪一直在下，似柳絮，若芦花，如白蝶，漫天飞舞，给旷原披上厚厚银装。一车一骑，车在前，骑在后。车辙碾过，马蹄踏过，转瞬便有飞雪填充上去，若隐若现。",
      "totalCount": 120
    }
